      "rationale": "The span explicitly identifies small subgroup counts as potentially insufficient within the practical temporal selection procedure."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C053.signal_basis",
    "value": "Compare comparable equipment and crew groups and observe whether a stage's delays recur on multiple booking days in each investigation week, with that stage contributing the greatest documented delay burden in both weeks.",
    "scope": "The two-week investigation uses this pattern as a provisional selection rule, without statistical proof or causal identification.",
